{"code":"lus","quarters":[{"id":"2026-04","title":"Hril Lâwkna Thilpêk","description":"Mihring thluak hnathawh dân zir mite (neuroscientists) chuan nausênte’n tawng an lo thiam theih nâna an thluakin hna a thawh dân an lo hre chho zêl a. Nausên chuan, thla 6 a lo tlinin a pianpui tawng (entîr nân, Mizo) emaw, khawvêla tawng hrang hrang 7,000 chuang awm zînga eng tawng pawh ni se, chumi tawng thumalte siamtu rî-te chu a lo hre hrang tan a. A pianpui tawng ni lo tawng dang rî pawh hriattîr thin ni ta se, chumi tawng pawh chu a lo hrethiam chhawm ve tho dâwn tihna a ni. Tin, hetih lâi vêl hian a rilru kawngka mak danglam tak chu lo inhawngin, a lo pian chhuaha a hriatthiam rî chi hrang hrang 800 vêl atanga amah châwi liantu a nu tawng siam chhuaktu rî 40 vêl zêl chu a lo hrethiam ta a. Mahse, chumi tûr chuan thil pakhat a thlen phawt a ngâi thung: amah chu biak lûmlâm thin a tûl thîn. Chutiang chu nausênte tâna tawng zirna ti pawhin kan sawi thei ang.","human_date":"October · November · December 2026","start_date":"26/09/2026","end_date":"25/12/2026","color_primary":"#5A2C32","color_primary_dark":"#541B23","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Siamtu’n Thu A Sawi Thîn","start_date":"26/09/2026","end_date":"02/10/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Zâwlneite Hnathawh","start_date":"03/10/2026","end_date":"09/10/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Thuthlung Hluia Zâwlneite","start_date":"10/10/2026","end_date":"16/10/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Thuthlung Thara Zâwlneite","start_date":"17/10/2026","end_date":"23/10/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Pathian Inpuanna leh Thâwk Khumna","start_date":"24/10/2026","end_date":"30/10/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Zâwlneite Thuziak","start_date":"31/10/2026","end_date":"06/11/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Tûnah Hei Hi Hre Rawh U!","start_date":"07/11/2026","end_date":"13/11/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Hril Lâwkna Thute Hrilhfiahin","start_date":"14/11/2026","end_date":"20/11/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Zâwlneite chu Fiahin","start_date