hran lo niin i inhria emaw pawh a ni maithei. I dinhmun chu eng pawh lo ni se, Pathian nêna inzawmna nung leh nghet neih dân tûr chungchâng hi chu i tân pawh thupui pawimawh tak a ni reng tho mai.","human_date":"April · May · June 2026","start_date":"28/03/2026","end_date":"26/06/2026","color_primary":"#0A454E","color_primary_dark":"#01373F","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Pathian Nêna In Inzawmna Kha A Nghet Tha Em?","start_date":"28/03/2026","end_date":"03/04/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Pathian Hre Tûrin","start_date":"04/04/2026","end_date":"10/04/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Inngaihhlutna nge Inngaihtlâwmna?","start_date":"11/04/2026","end_date":"17/04/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Bible Pawimawhna","start_date":"18/04/2026","end_date":"24/04/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Bible Zir Dân","start_date":"25/04/2026","end_date":"01/05/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Tawngtâi Thîn Mite","start_date":"02/05/2026","end_date":"08/05/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Tawngtâi Dân","start_date":"09/05/2026","end_date":"15/05/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Rinna Neiin","start_date":"16/05/2026","end_date":"22/05/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Sual, Chanchin Tha leh Dân","start_date":"23/05/2026","end_date":"29/05/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Sual Simna leh Ngaihdamna","start_date":"30/05/2026","end_date":"05/06/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Bahhlahnate","start_date":"06/06/2026","end_date":"12/06/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Mi Dangte Hnênah Hrilh Ve Rawh","start_date":"13/06/2026","end_date":"19/06/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Isua Nên Chatuanin","start_date":"20/06/2026","end_date":"26/06/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-02-cc","title":"Survivor Stories","description":"Cornerstone Connections-in a tum bulpui ber chu Pathian leh a mite chanchin hriat theih nâna Bible lama mi hruai a ni. He thu hian Eden Huana chhuan hmasa ber atanga keini chhuan thlenga chanchin sei tak chu a huam a. Lei leh vân Pathianin he leia a fate a rawn biak pawh dân chungchâng a ni.","human_date":"April · May · June 2026","start_date":"29/03/2026","end_date":"27/06/2026","color_primary":"#FABC69","color_primary_dark":"#C4893B","splash":false,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Hmangaihnain A Dawh Thei","start_date":"29/03/2026","end_date":"04/04/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Eizawnna Hna Bâk","start_date":"05/04/2026","end_date":"11/04/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"I Tâna Pathian Thinlung","start_date":"12/04/2026","end_date":"18/04/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Chu Chu Ka Chanchin A Ni","start_date":"19/04/2026","end_date":"25/04/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Rinawmna Chuai Mai Lo","start_date":"26/04/2026","end_date":"02/05/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Sumdâwnna Hmunte","start_date":"03/05/2026","end_date":"09/05/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Chanchin Lâwmawm","start_date":"10/05/2026","end_date":"16/05/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Inla Hrang Bîk Lovin","start_date":"17/05/2026","end_date":"23/05/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Mi Pakhat Sipai","start_date":"24/05/2026","end_date":"30/05/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Hmangaihna Thiltihtheihna","start_date":"31/05/2026","end_date":"06/06/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Thupuan Chu","start_date":"07/06/2026","end_date":"13/06/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Chatuana Rinawm","start_date":"14/06/2026","end_date":"20/06/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Êng Angin","start_date":"21/06/2026","end_date":"27/06/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-03","title":"1 leh 2 Korinth","description":"Lehkhathawn ziah hi hmasâng ata tawh kan la chîn chhunzawm tâk zêl a ni a, kan ziah dân hmang erawh a danglam ta deuh thung. Lehkhaphêk-a ziak tawh lovin, social media hrang hrang kan hmang ta deuh ber hlawm a. Nimahsela, a nihna takah chuan email leh WhatsApp te pawh hian hmânlâia an lo hman thin lehkhathawnin a thawh ang tho kha an la thawk a ni tih kan hre theuh âwm e. Mi dangte hnênah an hriat atâna tûl kan tihte hrilhin, kan ngaihdân leh ngaihtuahna te kan hriattîr a, chutiang chuan mi hrang hrangte kan inthlun zawm kual vek a nih hi.","human_date":"July · August · September 2026","start_date":"27/06/2026","end_date":"25/09/2026","color_primary":"#605045","color_primary_dark":"#4B3C32","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Korinth Khuaa Paula Rawngbâwlna","start_date":"27/06/2026","end_date":"03/07/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Kraws Thu","start_date":"04/07/2026","end_date":"10/07/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Kristaa Inpumkhatna","start_date":"11/07/2026","end_date":"17/07/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Kohhrana Sualna","start_date":"18/07/2026","end_date":"24/07/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Engkim Pathian Ropuina Tûr Zêlin","start_date":"25/07/2026","end_date":"31/07/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Thlarau Thilpêkte","start_date":"01/08/2026","end_date":"07/08/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Hmangaihna Nihna Dik Tak Lantîrtu","start_date":"08/08/2026","end_date":"14/08/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Krista Thawhlehna Thiltihtheihna","start_date":"15/08/2026","end_date":"21/08/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Hmangaih Rawngbâwl Hna","start_date":"22/08/2026","end_date":"28/08/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Kristian Rawngbâwlna Dik","start_date":"29/08/2026","end_date":"04/09/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Enkawltu Nihna leh Chanchin Tha Hril Hna","start_date":"05/09/2026","end_date":"11/09/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Zirtîrtu Derte Hmachhawnin","start_date":"12/09/2026","end_date":"18/09/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Khawngaihna, Hmangaihna leh Inpâwlna Hona","start_date":"19/09/2026","end_date":"25/09/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-01","title":"Lei Leh Vân Inremtîr A Chhûnga Thu Awmte","description":"I thil tih tawh azawnga harsa i tih ber kha han ngaihtuah lêt leh teh. Eng vânga harsa ti êm êm nge i nih? Nangma’n i theih phâk bâka ti tûra phût i nih vânga harsa ti nge i nih a, chumi tihna atâna hun i neih chu a tlêm tham êm vâng zâwk? Nangma’n i tih châk loh zâwng tak a nih avânga harsa ti te i ni em? Nge ni a, i thawhpuite’n an zir loh avâng emaw, in thawh hona a that loh vâng emaw zâwk? A nih loh pawhin, tih hlawhtlin theih loh nia i hriat avângin i huphurh sa ve hrim hrim a ni thei ang em?","human_date":"January · February · March 2026","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"27/03/2026","color_primary":"#2E4161","color_primary_dark":"#1E2C44","splash":true,"credits":[],"lessons":[{"number":1,"title":"Tihduhdaha Awm, Kalsan Ni Si Lo","start_date":"27/12/2025","end_date":"02/01/2026"},{"number":2,"title":"Lâwmthu Sawi leh Tawngtâi Chhan Tûte","start_date":"03/01/2026","end_date":"09/01/2026"},{"number":3,"title":"Nunna leh Thihna","start_date":"10/01/2026","end_date":"16/01/2026"},{"number":4,"title":"Inngaihtlâwmna Zâra Inpumkhatna","start_date":"17/01/2026","end_date":"23/01/2026"},{"number":5,"title":"Zân Thim Hnuaia Êng","start_date":"24/01/2026","end_date":"30/01/2026"},{"number":6,"title":"Kristaah Chauh Rinna Nghatin","start_date":"31/01/2026","end_date":"06/02/2026"},{"number":7,"title":"Vân Khua leh Tui Nihna","start_date":"07/02/2026","end_date":"13/02/2026"},{"number":8,"title":"Krista: A Hmasa Ber leh Pawimawh Ber","start_date":"14/02/2026","end_date":"20/02/2026"},{"number":9,"title":"Inremna leh Beiseina","start_date":"21/02/2026","end_date":"27/02/2026"},{"number":10,"title":"Kristaa Famkim","start_date":"28/02/2026","end_date":"06/03/2026"},{"number":11,"title":"Krista Nên Nungin","start_date":"07/03/2026","end_date":"13/03/2026"},{"number":12,"title":"Mi Dangte Nêna Chên Ho","start_date":"14/03/2026","end_date":"20/03/2026"},{"number":13,"title":"Pathian Duhzâwng Ang Apiang Ti Zêlin","start_date":"21/03/2026","end_date":"27/03/2026"}]},{"id":"2026-02-pp","title":"Year C, Second Quarter","description":"Pathian hnên atanga thil thlâwn pêk i ni a, A hmangaih êm êm che a ni! Lalpa’n arsite khi an hminga a hre vek a nih a, zân tinin an awmna tûrah an awm tih a hre ziah thei a nih chuan (Isaia 40:26), chûngte ai chuan engtiang taka hlu nge i nih ang le?","human_date":"April · May · June 2026","start_date":"29/03/2026","end_date":"27/06/2026","color_primary":"#3C474D","color_primary_dark":